## 6. Page Architecture

The main application shall contain the following functional areas.

### 6.1 Dashboard

The dashboard will provide:

* Total employees
* Active employees
* Employees on leave
* Employees on bench
* Employees under training
* Employees on PIP
* Attendance summary
* Leave summary
* Performance summary
* Training summary
* Recruitment summary
* Department-level workforce information

---

### 6.2 Employee Management

Employee pages shall support:

* Employee list
* Employee search
* Employee filtering
* Employee details
* Create employee
* Edit employee
* Lifecycle status
* Department
* Role
* Work status
* Salary information
* Department-specific active status

Backend integration:

```text
/api/employees
```

---

### 6.3 Department Management

The frontend shall provide department information and management functionality.

Backend:

```text
/api/departments
```

---

### 6.4 Job Role Management

The frontend shall provide job-role information.

Backend:

```text
/api/job-roles
```

---

### 6.5 Workforce Status

The frontend shall display work statuses such as:

```text
WORKING
ONLINE
TRAINING
ON_BENCH
PIP
ON_LEAVE
OFFLINE
REMOTE
```

Backend:

```text
/api/work-statuses
```

---

